Package: radr
Type: Package
Title: Explore, Diagnose and Filter Genomic Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-17
Authors@R: c(
  person("Thierry", "Gosselin", email = "thierrygosselin@icloud.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Maintainer: Thierry Gosselin <thierrygosselin@icloud.com>
Description: Explores, diagnoses, visualizes, and filters individual genomic
    data stored in Genomic Data Structure ('GDS') files. Tools identify
    genotyping problems, unusual samples and markers, population-genetic
    patterns, and other signals that can influence downstream genomic analyses.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://thierrygosselin.github.io/radr/,
